title: Adopt npm-package-arg 14 after the Node 22 runtime floor reaches 22.22.2
description: "Own the npm-package-arg 14.0.0 major separately from routine dependency refreshes. Upstream requires Node ^22.22.2, ^24.15.0, or >=26 while pm currently promises >=22.18.0, so adoption would violate the supported Node 22 runtime floor."
